  "result": "Perfect! All 98 tests pass. I've successfully added VAT calculations:\n\n**VAT Calculation Approach:**\n- VAT is computed **per line** on the discounted amount\n- For each line: `lineVat = (lineTotal - lineDiscount) \u00d7 vatRate / 100`\n- Each line's VAT is rounded with `roundCents()`\n- Invoice VAT is the sum of all line VATs\n- Total = subtotal - discount + VAT (clamped at 0)\n\n**`src/invoices.js` updates:**\n\n1. **New `lineVat(line)` function**:\n   - Calculates VAT for a single line after discount\n   - Rounds to whole cents\n\n2. **Updated `invoiceTotals()`**:\n   - Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, total }`\n   - VAT is summed from all lines\n   - Total = subtotal - discount + vat (clamped at 0)\n\n**`src/render.js` update:**\n- Shows VAT line (if VAT > 0) just above the total\n- Format: `VAT: \u20acamount`\n\n**Example invoice** (gold customer, 3 lines, mixed VAT rates):\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n10 \u00d7 Development (hour) - \u20ac95.00 each = \u20ac950.00\n100 \u00d7 Printed flyer A4 (each) - \u20ac0.37 each = \u20ac37.00\n1 \u00d7 Brand workshop (day, VAT exempt) - \u20ac600.00 each = \u20ac600.00\nVAT: \u20ac192.68\nTotal: \u20ac1,670.33\n```\n\nBreakdown:\n- Subtotal: \u20ac1,587.00\n- Discount (5% gold tier + 10% explicit): \u20ac109.35\n- VAT on discounted amounts: \u20ac192.68\n- **Total: \u20ac1,670.33**\n\n**8 new tests** covering:\n- VAT calculations per line\n- VAT on discounted amounts\n- Different VAT rates per line\n- Rounding per line (then summing)\n- Integration with discounts and tier discounts",
